cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use these run records or the benchmark harness, please cite this
  archive and the manuscript it accompanies.
type: dataset
title: "VCF-RDFizer evaluation: benchmark harness, run records, and figure sources"
abstract: >-
  The evaluation of VCF-RDFizer reported in "VCF-RDFizer: From a VCF File to
  Explicit, Verifiable, and Policy-aware Semantic Genomic Data": the benchmark
  harness, the run records of every reported result, the manuscript and
  supplement sources, and the scripts that draw every figure from the records.
